[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12066.15, "timestamp": "03:21:06", "text": "所以如果我运行这个按钮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12069.51, "timestamp": "03:21:09", "text": "，就会发生这种情况：如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12071.429, "timestamp": "03:21:11", "text": "运行这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12074.95, "timestamp": "03:21:14", "text": "编辑触发器，添加一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12079.11, "timestamp": "03:21:19", "text": "3.00 毫秒的重复间隔，等于 3 秒，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12082.469, "timestamp": "03:21:22", "text": "运行它。 保存。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12084.229, "timestamp": "03:21:24", "text": "所以接下来就会发生的情况是，它会一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12086.389, "timestamp": "03:21:26", "text": "运行下去，一直运行下去，一直运行下去。 如您"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12089.59, "timestamp": "03:21:29", "text": "所见，每隔 3 秒就会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12092.55, "timestamp": "03:21:32", "text": "运行一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12094.79, "timestamp": "03:21:34", "text": "每隔3秒运行一次。 按钮运行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12100.15, "timestamp": "03:21:40", "text": "现在是7次。  1 2 3 8 就这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12102.55, "timestamp": "03:21:42", "text": "运行着。 既然已经在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12105.11, "timestamp": "03:21:45", "text": "Twitch 上发了消息并踢了对方，那就没"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12108.71, "timestamp": "03:21:48", "text": "问题了。 不过，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12110.229, "timestamp": "03:21:50", "text": "这还"}]